      "writtenOn": "2020-08-28T21:32:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "At line 68, i saw that we use getStem(ctx) used for the output .rs file base name.\nShouldn\u0027t we just reuse source_stem property as the user configurable module name?\nIt\u0027s Rust convention to import/include modules from files with the same name.",
